nce"}],"notes":"Head office Level 21, 201 Miller St, North Sydney NSW. At the KKR announcement (July 2025) it operated over 50 distributed generation sites in Australia, including over 140MW of solar assets and 35MWh of battery storage, and was delivering over $200m of construction projects. No CFO title on the team page; the cfo slot holds the GM Finance.","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://cleanpeakenergy.com.au/kkr-forms-a500m-strategic-partnership-with-cleanpeak-energy-to-launch-new-distributed-energy-platform/","name":"CleanPeak Energy","kind":"company","as_of":"2025-07-28","evidence":"CleanPeak is a specialist renewable energy company in Australia empowering large industrial & commercial businesses to reduce their carbon emissions & transition to net zero. CleanPeak specialises in designing, building, owning and operating renewable energy assets, and associated infrastructure."},"founded_year":{"url":"https://cleanpeakenergy.com.au/kkr-forms-a500m-strategic-partnership-with-cleanpeak-energy-to-launch-new-distributed-energy-platform/","name":"CleanPeak Energy","kind":"company","as_of":"2025-07-28","evidence":"Co-founded by Philip Graham and Jon Hare in 2017, CleanPeak is a leading provider of fully financed, integrated solar and storage systems for bluechip corporates across Australia."},"country":{"url":"https://cleanpeakenergy.com.au/contact/","name":"CleanPeak Energy","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Head Office Level 21, 201 Miller St North Sydney NSW 2060"},"sector":{"url":"https://www.kkr.com/invest/portfolio","name":"KKR","kind":"sponsor","as_of":null,"evidence":"CleanPeak Energy | Sydney, Australia | assetClass Infrastructure | industry Utilities | yoi 2026"},"business_model":{"url":"https://cleanpeakenergy.com.au/kkr-forms-a500m-strategic-partnership-with-cleanpeak-energy-to-launch-new-distributed-energy-platform/","name":"CleanPeak Energy","kind":"company","as_of":"2025-07-28","evidence":"a leading provider of fully financed, integrated