n","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2025-12-16","evidence":"the company employs nearly 10,000 people and operates across the country through nearly 450 stores in France"},"revenue":{"url":"https://www.ardian.com/news-insights/press-releases/ardian-announces-sale-its-stake-prosol-apollo","name":"Ardian","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2025-12-16","evidence":"The company generated revenues of more than €4.2 billion last year."},"business_model":{"url":"https://ir.apollo.com/news-events/press-releases/detail/623/apollo-funds-complete-acquisition-of-prosol-group","name":"Apollo Global Management","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-05-07","evidence":"Prosol operates and/or supplies nearly 450 stores across France under two main banners, Grand Frais and fresh."}},"holding":{"sponsor":"Apollo Global Management","status":"current","status_note":"Apollo Funds completed acquisition of a majority stake from Ardian on 7 May 2026; existing minority shareholders and management reinvested","asset_class":"Private equity","deal_type":"Secondary buyout","value_creation_plan":"As Prosol looks to expand its estate both in France and internationally, Apollo will draw on its extensive retail expertise to support the management team's growth plans while maintaining the distinctive identity beloved by customers.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.apollo.com/insights-news/pressreleases/2025/12/apollo-funds-to-acquire-prosol-group-a-leading-french-fresh-food-retailer-3205948","notes":"Agreement announced 16 Dec 2025; completed 7 May 2026. UBS lead financial adviser to Apollo Funds, with RBC and Lazard."}},{"name":"Prosol Group","description":"A leading player in specialised food retail in France, Prosol has been developing an integrated, fresh-food-focused model for more than 30 years, exercising full control over the value chain from agricultural sourcing to distribution.","sector":"Consumer","subsector":"Fresh food retail and wholesale (Grand Frais, fresh.)","country":"France","founded_year":1992,"b